    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the Good Dog Club. Bark fast and bark strong. Rocket jump your way through increasingly difficult levels and don't let anything slow you down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Indomitable Rocket Dog is a fast paced, physics-based, 2D platformer time-trial game. Use your rockets to propel yourself through each area as fast as you can and earn a perfect rank on each level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by games like N++, Neon White, &amp; Sonic, you'll have to master your physics and momentum to get perfect times.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game includes a full level editor &amp; leaderboards with the ability to watch world-record runs. It is currently under development and will hopefully release in 2026!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the Good Dog Club. Bark fast and bark strong. Rocket jump your way through increasingly difficult levels and don't let anything slow you down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Indomitable Rocket Dog is a fast paced, physics-based, 2D platformer time-trial game. Use your rockets to propel yourself through each area as fast as you can and earn a perfect rank on each level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by games like N++, Neon White, &amp; Sonic, you'll have to master your physics and momentum to get perfect times.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game includes a full level editor &amp; leaderboards with the ability to watch world-record runs. It is currently under development and will hopefully release in 2026!</p>",
